# Cloudflare Pages headers.
# COOP/COEP make the site cross-origin isolated, enabling SharedArrayBuffer —
# required by the interactive stdin bridge (Python and C/C++ input()).
# Safe here because every asset, including all WASM runtimes, is same-origin.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# Runtimes are immutable at their versioned paths — cache hard.
/runtimes/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/monaco/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
